msgstr "Odabrana kamera se ne može otvoriti"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Pokušajte odabrati neki drugi"

#: src/onboarding.py:575
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Molimo posjetite\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"kako biste omogućili svoj IR emiter"

#: src/onboarding.py:643
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Postavljanje osvjetljenje 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Postavljanje osvjetljenje 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Nije moguće spremiti model lica"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Skeniraj drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Nije moguće snimiti drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi model je spremljen, tako da prijava licem već radi. Soba i dalje "
"mora biti dovoljno svijetla da vam se vidi lice - promijenite svjetlo "
"umjesto da ga isključite - zatim pokušajte ponovno ili preskočite i dodajte "
"model kasnije iz postavki."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Drugo skeniranje: drugačije osvjetljenje"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Prvi model spremljen. Sada promijenite svjetlo — na primjer upalite ili "
"ugasite svjetiljku, odmaknite se od prozora ili upotrijebite drugo sobno "
"svjetlo — neka vaše lice bude jasno vidljivo, a zatim ponovno pritisnite "
"Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autentičnosti "
"lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> Provjera TPM hardvera i alata..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autentičnosti "
"lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> TPM hardver otkriven. Automatsko instaliranje <i>tpm2-"
"tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autentičnosti "
"lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> Hardverski TPM 2.0 aktivan. Vaša lozinka bit će sigurno "
"zapečaćena unutar TPM-a."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autentičnosti "
"lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> otkriven je TPM hardver, ali automatska instalacija "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> nije uspjela. Pokrenite <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</"
"code>. Vraćanje na softversko predmemoriranje vjerodajnica."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello može automatski otključati vaš {} pomoću provjere autentičnosti "
"lica (otkriveni novčanik: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM status:</b> TPM hardver nije otkriven. Korištenje softverskog "
"predmemoriranja vjerodajnica (AES-256-GCM)."

